<title>USA: AES Corp starts secondary offering.</title>
<headline>AES Corp starts secondary offering.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AES Corp said it began an offering of 4,113,164 shares of its common stock, plus an overallotment option of up to an additional 616,974 shares, from its shelf registration statement.</p>
<p>Salomon Brothers Inc is acting as the underwriter for the offering.  Proceeds will be used to repay certain acquisition indebtedness to provide financial flexibility for future transactions, it said.</p>
</text>
